EFFECT_SOURCE_SUMMARY {"repeat":1,"baseline":"8214a543bc44e88d979f9e4457d7370e7e3c122b","candidate":"a8bbe0984f270070eba9bc166a89909d0c67597e","results":[{"variant":"base","exit":0,"outcome":{"ms":18381.236731,"exit":0,"rules":[{"entry":"make","ok":true,"notes":["jobs is an Effect 4 Queue (bounded, 4 items), modelled: jobs_items, jobs_head, jobs_tail, jobs_open; it holds the items at jobs_head .. jobs_tail - 1, oldest first; an offer to it full waits; a take from it empty waits","workers is an Effect 4 Semaphore of 2 permits, modelled: workers_taken, the permits taken, and workers_held, those the calling fiber holds (its takes less its releases; under many fibers each fiber's, summing to workers_taken); a take waits until they are free, a release gives them back unchecked (as Effect does); withPermits is the take, its body's statements, the release (a failure in the body releasing first)","calls from many fibers at once: work is 4 steps (each transaction or Ref operation one), the fibers interleaving them: the rule is every fiber's (lift: each fiber's place and what it carries a map keyed by the input fiber, the service's Refs (jobs_head, jobs_tail, workers_taken, spent) shared); each other method is one step. A request is one fiber's next step: a fiber in the middle of a call takes its next step whatever method the request names. A failure in a later step ends the call as a return does. A law reads the service's Refs","make is an Effect service: its state is its Refs, each method an event, a failure the step's refusal; each method is one step, which holds where calls don't interleave (one at a time, or under a Semaphore of 1)","make makes an object of functions: its state is what they close over (jobs_items, jobs_head, jobs_tail, jobs_open, workers_taken, workers_held, spent, __gdp_pc, __gdp_work_cost), its arguments the params","a transaction that waits (STM.check, STM.retry, Effect.txRetry) is not taken until a TRef it read changes: the rule refuses the request (